  ('827c4da7-1e11-4ea0-86cf-87e36ed363b7','Laguna Woods is a large active-adult community in Orange County, and Laguna Woods Archery Club reflects that with a USA Archery affiliated Adult Archery Program rather than youth-focused offerings. That makes it a fairly unusual profile among directory listings, a club structured specifically around adult participation in a community built for retirees and older residents. USA Archery affiliation means the program follows a recognized coaching structure even without a JOAD youth track attached to it. Details on course setup, equipment, or lesson format beyond the program name aren''t listed here. Prospective members, particularly residents of the community, should contact the club directly to ask about joining and current schedules.'),
